OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 29 APR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto Kinch is back with another
OL,12,     Ghour of the best in jazz, and
OL,13,     GRosa Brunello has another Flowers
OL,14,     Gselection to reveal.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GFrancesco Piemontesi joins
OL,17,     Gconductor Maxim Emelyanychev and
OL,18,     Gthe Swedish Radio Symphony
OL,19,     GOrchestra in Brahms's Piano
OL,20,     GConcerto No 1. The orchestra also
OL,21,     Gplays Mahler's 5th Symphony.
